WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:10.380
A data center might have multiple layers of defense.

2
00:00:10.819 --> 00:00:14.409
We would have administrative controls such as policies and procedures,

3
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:19.030
then logical or technical controls which include programming to limit access.

4
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.879
There are also physical controls which we sometimes

5
00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:24.270
forget about in our highly technical world.

6
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.829
Regardless of how much we focus on cloud computing and virtualization.

7
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.850
There is always a physical location where information is being stored

8
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.330
or processed in a physical hard drive in a physical computer.

9
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.930
Even in a data center in a

10
00:00:36.939 --> 00:00:39.930
large organization that provides cloud computing services.

11
00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:40.799
For example,

12
00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:44.970
there is still a physical aspect of information storage and processing.